{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 404, "line_no": 9, "text": "边唱边把“桥棒”移到夫妻卧室门前，将其固定在门栏上。从此，逢年过节或办喜事", "bbox_px": {"x": 173, "y": 706, "w": 1468, "h": 72}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "边唱边把“桥棒”移到夫妻卧室门前，将其固定在门栏上。从此，逢年过节或办喜事", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 173, "y": 706, "w": 1468, "h": 72}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 404, "line_no": 10, "text": "都得做菜敬奉。每次敬奉必斟酒、供饭、上香、烧纸，以保子女及全家老幼平安、幸福。①", "bbox_px": {"x": 96, "y": 776, "w": 1504, "h": 61}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "都得做菜敬奉。每次敬奉必斟酒、供饭、上香、烧纸，以保子女及全家老幼平安、幸福。①", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 96, "y": 776, "w": 1504, "h": 61}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 404, "line_no": 11, "text": "布依戏。", "bbox_px": {"x": 177, "y": 845, "w": 149, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "布依戏。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 177, "y": 845, "w": 149, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 404, "line_no": 12, "text": "包括布依戏和布依彩调戏。流传在南盘江沿岸布依族地区。", "bbox_px": {"x": 177, "y": 909, "w": 1049, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "包括布依戏和布依彩调戏。流传在南盘江沿岸布依族地区。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 177, "y": 909, "w": 1049, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 404, "line_no": 13, "text": "布依戏是我国17个少数民族剧种之一，约形成于清乾隆年间，它是在布依族民间说", "bbox_px": {"x": 177, "y": 974, "w": 1463, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "布依戏是我国17个少数民族剧种之一，约形成于清乾隆年间，它是在布依族民间说", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 177, "y": 974, "w": 1463, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 404, "line_no": 14, "text": "唱艺术基础上，吸收其他民族戏剧艺术的有益成分发展而成，逢婚嫁、起房盖屋、节日喜", "bbox_px": {"x": 96, "y": 1042, "w": 1540, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "唱艺术基础上，吸收其他民族戏剧艺术的有益成分发展而成，逢婚嫁、起房盖屋、节日喜", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 96, "y": 1042, "w": 1540, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 404, "line_no": 15, "text": "宴等活动作庆贺演出。", "bbox_px": {"x": 92, "y": 1106, "w": 398, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "宴等活动作庆贺演出。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 92, "y": 1106, "w": 398, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 404, "line_no": 16, "text": "布依戏音乐曲调有《正调》、《过场调》、《升堂调》、《梳妆调》、《莲花调》、《马倒铃", "bbox_px": {"x": 177, "y": 1167, "w": 1463, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "布依戏音乐曲调有《正调》、《过场调》、《升堂调》、《梳妆调》、《莲花调》、《马倒铃", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 177, "y": 1167, "w": 1463, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 404, "line_no": 17, "text": "调》、《反璜调》和《武打调》等。", "bbox_px": {"x": 96, "y": 1239, "w": 531, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "调》、《反璜调》和《武打调》等。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 96, "y": 1239, "w": 531, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 404, "line_no": 18, "text": "布依戏以牛骨琴和葫芦琴", "bbox_px": {"x": 1142, "y": 1300, "w": 494, "h": 44}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "布依戏以牛骨琴和葫芦琴", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 1142, "y": 1300, "w": 494, "h": 44}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 404, "line_no": 19, "text": "主要乐器。牛骨琴比京胡音色清", "bbox_px": {"x": 1065, "y": 1368, "w": 571, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "主要乐器。牛骨琴比京胡音色清", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 1065, "y": 1368, "w": 571, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 404, "line_no": 20, "text": "脆，葫芦琴音色浑厚、稳重。其他", "bbox_px": {"x": 1065, "y": 1428, "w": 579, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "脆，葫芦琴音色浑厚、稳重。其他", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 1065, "y": 1428, "w": 579, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 404, "line_no": 21, "text": "乐器有竹笛、三弦、月琴。打击乐", "bbox_px": {"x": 1061, "y": 1497, "w": 575, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "乐器有竹笛、三弦、月琴。打击乐", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 1061, "y": 1497, "w": 575, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 404, "line_no": 22, "text": "器有锣、铙、小鼓、打板等，主奏乐", "bbox_px": {"x": 1061, "y": 1557, "w": 579, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "器有锣、铙、小鼓、打板等，主奏乐", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 1061, "y": 1557, "w": 579, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 404, "line_no": 23, "text": "器在伴奏时，常用正反弦互相配", "bbox_px": {"x": 1061, "y": 1625, "w": 579, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "器在伴奏时，常用正反弦互相配", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 1061, "y": 1625, "w": 579, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 404, "line_no": 24, "text": "合演奏，牛骨琴定1~5弦，胡琴", "bbox_px": {"x": 1061, "y": 1690, "w": 579, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "合演奏，牛骨琴定1~5弦，胡琴", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 1061, "y": 1690, "w": 579, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 404, "line_no": 25, "text": "定5~2弦。", "bbox_px": {"x": 1061, "y": 1751, "w": 211, "h": 55}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "定5~2弦。", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 1061, "y": 1751, "w": 211, "h": 55}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 404, "line_no": 26, "text": "布依戏的服装，是根据各种", "bbox_px": {"x": 1146, "y": 1814, "w": 499, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "布依戏的服装，是根据各种", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 1146, "y": 1814, "w": 499, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
